{"version":1,"content":"<p>Mozilla宣佈，自11月10日起至2027年1月31日，Firefox瀏覽器內置的免費VPN服務將暫時取消流量限制。活動期間，所有登錄Mozilla賬户並使用該功能的用户都可以獲得無限流量訪問權限，無需額外付費或安裝獨立應用程式。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585974.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:51:20.391632+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:23:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:39.679313+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:39.679313+00:00","content_hash":"1d40a70d2de21a84f45bf0eb2d195d09043341ab3cdb7a4c21959e032ac9af18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}